  "body": "Situated right in the heart of Gulf Harbour, this expansive 1201m2 vacant section offers an incredibly rare opportunity to secure premium waterfront marina land. Whether you are looking to build a spectacular marina-front masterpiece or capitalize on its significant development potential, this blank canvas is ready for your vision.\r\n\r\nA massive bonus for boating enthusiasts: the property comes complete with its own 12-meter marina berth. Furthermore, there is strong potential to subdivide the site, offering the unique advantage of acquiring additional optional berths for each new title created.\r\n\r\nThe vendor has already explored several avenues for the site, providing excellent inspiration and foundational planning for the new owner:\r\n\r\n* Premium Housing: A concept plan is available for three standalone dwellings.\r\n* High-Density Potential: The site previously held a resource consent for a 9-unit apartment complex, proving the impressive scope and scale this land can accommodate.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n* Land Area: 1201m2 vacant section\r\n\r\n* Location: Absolute marina frontage in the heart of Gulf Harbour\r\n\r\n* Berth: Includes one 12-meter berth\r\n\r\n* Subdivision Potential: Option for additional berths per newly created title\r\n\r\n* Development Ready: Concept plans for 3 standalones available; historic precedent for 9 apartments\r\n\r\nPremium waterfront sections of this size and capability are exceptionally rare. Bring your architect, your builder, and your imagination. Contact us today to view the concept plans, and secure your piece of Gulf Harbour.",
